      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1959,
      "compression_ratio": 1.0901
    },
    {
      "text": "这道题啊",
      "start": 201.76,
      "end": 203.07999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "说在大众印象当中",
      "start": 203.07999999999998,
      "end": 204.6,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "艺术品的鉴定是一件看上去",
      "start": 204.6,
      "end": 206.94,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么样的一个事情",
      "start": 206.94,
      "end": 208.1,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "那么后面说几位苍老的专家",
      "start": 208.1,
      "end": 211.76,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "围着一幅字画",
      "start": 211.76,
      "end": 213.06,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "反复的端详",
      "start": 213.06,
      "end": 214.39999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "来大家看啊",
      "start": 214.39999999999998,
      "end": 215.26,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "第二孔",
      "start": 215.26,
      "end": 215.7,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "他是形容大众眼中当中艺术品",
      "start": 215.7,
      "end": 219.35999999999999,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "鉴定的这件事",
      "start": 219.35999999999999,
      "end": 220.7,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "对不对",
      "start": 220.7,
      "end": 221.48,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "大家想",
      "start": 221.48,
      "end": 222.32,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "艺术品鉴定",
      "start": 222.32,
      "end": 223.7,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "是不是有一种外行",
      "start": 223.7,
      "end": 225.29999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "看不懂",
      "start": 225.29999999999998,
      "end": 225.98,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "门槛很高",
      "start": 225.98,
      "end": 227.28,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "有一种神秘感",
      "start": 227.28,
      "end": 228.66,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "是不是高深莫测",
      "start": 228.66,
      "end": 231.35999999999999,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1292,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4015
    },
    {
      "text": "这解课我们讲了",
      "start": 231.36,
      "end": 232.98000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "就是专门可以形容什么专业门槛高",
      "start": 232.98000000000002,
      "end": 235.96,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "外行难以看透",
      "start": 235.96,
      "end": 238.04000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "看懂",
      "start": 238.04000000000002,
      "end": 238.60000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "所以高深莫测他对应的特别好",
      "start": 238.60000000000002,
      "end": 241.56,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "对不对",
      "start": 241.56,
      "end": 242.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "慧莫如深是死死咬住不提",
      "start": 242.0,
      "end": 245.3,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "对不对",
      "start": 245.3,
      "end": 246.54000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "他没有说鉴定行业是故意",
      "start": 246.54000000000002,
      "end": 249.48000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "遮掩撬门的",
      "start": 249.48000000000002,
      "end": 251.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "他不提的守住秘密的",
      "start": 251.0,
      "end": 253.48000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "他只是普通人看不懂",
      "start": 253.48000000000002,
      "end": 255.98000000000002,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "对不对",
      "start": 255.98000000000002,
      "end": 256.76,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "所以慧莫如深不行",
      "start": 256.76,
      "end": 258.38,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "好再来看这个百思不解",
      "start": 258.38,
      "end": 260.98,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1705,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3745
    },
    {
      "text": "百思不解",
      "start": 260.98,
      "end": 262.42,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "是指这个人反复的思索依旧想不通",
      "start": 262.42,
      "end": 266.3,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "所以这个主语只能是人",
      "start": 266.3,
      "end": 269.32,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "因为解嘛",
      "start": 269.32,
      "end": 270.28000000000003,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "还有一个解惑的感觉",
      "start": 270.28000000000003,
      "end": 272.5,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "不能说这个事情看上去百思不解",
      "start": 272.5,
      "end": 276.36,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "是指这个人对于某件事百思不解",
      "start": 276.36,
      "end": 279.82,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "对不对",
      "start": 279.82,
      "end": 280.48,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "所以C不对",
      "start": 280.48,
      "end": 281.34000000000003,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "这个主语只能是人",
      "start": 281.34000000000003,
      "end": 282.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1258,
      "compression_ratio": 1.602
    },
    {
